  solid black capsule with the sheet's five-bar waveform at rest, the widget's
  own sleeping face. The bar geometry is ic_widget_wave_sleep's, centered in
  the 2x2 cell the widget occupies; API 31+ hosts render the live layout
  instead (previewLayout) and never see this.
-->
